  m_Name: continuous_fire
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KeywordConfiguration
  Id: continuous_fire
  DisplayName: Continuous Fire
  RulesText: "This weapon has an increased chance of damaging the enemy, but may
    overheat if fired for a prolonged period. \nWhen a weapon with this keyword is
    used in a Ranged test, it benefits from Weight of Fire (2). At the end of the
    current Shoot action, the model that used the weapon must make a 3 dice Survive
    test (2). If the test is failed it takes 1 wound. Armour and Energy Shields do
    not protect against this damage. If this kills the model, the kill is awarded
    to the opposing player.\n"
